#. comic460 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:35
msgctxt "comic460#title.1"
msgid "\"THE ANSWER, MY FRIEND\""
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: scrowd.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:72
msgctxt "comic460#p1.1"
msgid "Sheena calls a meeting."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: scrowd.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:78
msgctxt "comic460#p1.2"
msgid "I've spent a lot of time researching these files called \"Walkthroughs,\" trying to identify games that contain unique individuals."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenafront.gif, bogeytable7.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:130
msgctxt "comic460#p2.1"
msgid "Then I found \"Mofo.\" It's an unusual game whose final boss is theoretically indestructible."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenafront.gif, bogeytable7.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:134
msgctxt "comic460#p2.2"
msgid "Really? Then how does the player win?"
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: buddha.gif, sheenaleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:181
msgctxt "comic460#p3.1"
msgid "By using his head. It's basically a scripted battle, where all attempts to use force fail. The player will lose unless he figures out to use the often-overlooked \"Meditate\" move."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chead.gif, sheenastare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:233
msgctxt "comic460#p4.1"
msgid "Since that move is the only way to beat the boss, and Crystal is highly unlikely to have the \"weak\" character with that move in her army..."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatabler.gif, bogeytable8.gif, raddtablew2.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:286
msgctxt "comic460#p5.1"
msgid "The final boss of this game would be unstoppable, wiping out the Mod army singlehandedly."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenatabler.gif, bogeytable8.gif, raddtablew2.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:288
msgctxt "comic460#p5.2"
msgid "Whoa."
msgstr ""

#. comic460 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatabler.gif, bogeytable8.gif, raddtablew2.gif
#: kidradd/comic460.htm:290
msgctxt "comic460#p5.3"
msgid "With pause for impact."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:47
msgctxt "comic461#title.1"
msgid "\"PLANNING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, bogeystand.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:88
msgctxt "comic461#p1.1"
msgid "Wow, we're really gonna be able to beat the Mods? There's gotta be a catch!"
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, bogeystand.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:92
msgctxt "comic461#p1.2"
msgid "Of course. The bad news is, getting him out won't be easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenafront.gif, ibtableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:143
msgctxt "comic461#p2.1"
msgid "The game is an RPG, and we're not very well-designed characters for that type of world. Only IB is from one, and he's not a fighter."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenafront.gif, ibtableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:147
msgctxt "comic461#p2.2"
msgid "Well, not in there anyway."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:190
msgctxt "comic461#p3.1"
msgid "\"I can't attack directly, but in the outside world I can cheat a little. But in an RPG battle that won't work.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:191
msgctxt "comic461#p3.2"
msgid "\"Still, we need you to go in. Your cures will keep the party alive.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtablehee.gif, ibtable2.gif, sheenatables.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:250
msgctxt "comic461#p4.1"
msgid "White mage."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbtablehee.gif, ibtable2.gif, sheenatables.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:252
msgctxt "comic461#p4.2"
msgid "Shut up."
msgstr ""

#. comic461 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtablehee.gif, ibtable2.gif, sheenatables.gif
#: kidradd/comic461.htm:254
msgctxt "comic461#p4.3"
msgid "Aaaanyways, who else is going?"
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:34
msgctxt "comic462#title.1"
msgid "\"THE LINEUP\""
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:75
msgctxt "comic462#p1.1"
msgid "Other than IB, it looks like Radd is the only other one of us suited for \"Mofo.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:79
msgctxt "comic462#p1.2"
msgid "What? You're not coming, Sheena?"
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: shblast.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:126
msgctxt "comic462#p2.1"
msgid "\"My attacks do only 3HP damage at a time, which is worthless in an RPG. And my ultimate attack would only come every 500 turns, so... I'm out.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:188
msgctxt "comic462#p3.1"
msgid "Basically, we're depending on your charge attacks and IB's infinite cures to keep you both alive and easily winning battles. Nobody else is necessary."
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crowdooh.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:237
msgctxt "comic462#p4.1"
msgid "Perhaps. But necessary or not, I'm going as well."
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: crowdooh.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:239
msgctxt "comic462#p4.2"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. comic462 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crowdooh.gif
#: kidradd/comic462.htm:241
msgctxt "comic462#p4.3"
msgid "And the crowd goes, \"Ooooh...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:34
msgctxt "comic463#title.1"
msgid "\"ENOUGH JIBBA-JABBA\""
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, sheenaleft.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:75
msgctxt "comic463#p1.1"
msgid "I have my doubts as to whether this boss will want to help us, but I'll assist you as well... just to make sure you stay alive."
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, sheenaleft.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:79
msgctxt "comic463#p1.2"
msgid "Uh, thanks I guess."
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable6.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:130
msgctxt "comic463#p2.1"
msgid "But can you really be useful in an RPG?"
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtable6.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:134
msgctxt "comic463#p2.2"
msgid "Don't worry. I may not be able to charge up like you, but my attacks and uh, other abilities are indeed powerful."
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabtable.gif, gibrun2.gif, ibbrun2.gif, raddbrun2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:181
msgctxt "comic463#p3.1"
msgid "Well uh, okay then... Best of luck guys, and do be careful."
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabtable.gif, gibrun2.gif, ibbrun2.gif, raddbrun2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:185
msgctxt "comic463#p3.2"
msgid "Am I ever not?"
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtablerm.gif, ibtabler2.gif, gitablerun2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:232
msgctxt "comic463#p4.1"
msgid "Geez, hasn't anyone heard of rhetorical questions?"
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddtablerm.gif, ibtabler2.gif, gitablerun2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:234
msgctxt "comic463#p4.2"
msgid "Wow, I really didn't expect <i>everyone</i> to yell \"YES!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic463 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtablerm.gif, ibtabler2.gif, gitablerun2.gif
#: kidradd/comic463.htm:236
msgctxt "comic463#p4.3"
msgid "Including myself, and I barely know the guy."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:47
msgctxt "comic464#title.1"
msgid "\"LAVA MY LIFE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:84
msgctxt "comic464#p1.1"
msgid "\"Let's do this.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:144
msgctxt "comic464#p2.1"
msgid "We're in."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:146
msgctxt "comic464#p2.2"
msgid "Uh, rather funky decor in here."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:148
msgctxt "comic464#p2.3"
msgid "Whoa, check it out."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gitable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:201
msgctxt "comic464#p3.1"
msgid "Obviously this is the hero's room, the starting point of the adventure. Before leaving we should check our surroundings for any hidden money or items."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gisigh.gif, ibwright.gif, lavalamp.gif, raddwleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:249
msgctxt "comic464#p4.1"
msgid "Sigh, I went almost ten seconds before I regretted volunteering."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gisigh.gif, ibwright.gif, lavalamp.gif, raddwleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:251
msgctxt "comic464#p4.2"
msgid "You're right Radd, it's like ya can't stop watching it."
msgstr ""

#. comic464 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gisigh.gif, ibwright.gif, lavalamp.gif, raddwleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic464.htm:253
msgctxt "comic464#p4.3"
msgid "Sooooo pretty..."
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:47
msgctxt "comic465#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"BLACK MAGIC WOMAN\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:88
msgctxt "comic465#p1.1"
msgid "We'd better get moving."
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:92
msgctxt "comic465#p1.2"
msgid "\"Good morning sonny! Do you feel rested now?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:144
msgctxt "comic465#p2.1"
msgid "Uh, it's afternoon and we're not... \"sonny.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:148
msgctxt "comic465#p2.2"
msgid "Of course you're not! That no-good grandson of mine never visits home!"
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsigh.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:196
msgctxt "comic465#p3.1"
msgid "Anyways, I guess that means we're not gonna find the heroes near here."
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsigh.gif, granny2.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:200
msgctxt "comic465#p3.2"
msgid "Damn straight ya aren't. By the way, do you wanna eat?"
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:249
msgctxt "comic465#p4.1"
msgid "Sure, I guess so."
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:253
msgctxt "comic465#p4.2"
msgid "Keen! <b>\"Have some PIZZA and scoot off to bed!\"</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:303
msgctxt "comic465#p5.1"
msgid "Wh- How the hell did we get back in here???"
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:305
msgctxt "comic465#p5.2"
msgid "Powerful magic, that one has."
msgstr ""

#. comic465 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy2.gif, ib.gif, raddright.gif, lavalamp.gif
#: kidradd/comic465.htm:307
msgctxt "comic465#p5.3"
msgid "I thought I was gonna get pizza..."
msgstr ""

#. comic466 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
