#. comic469 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: momenufg.gif
#: kidradd/comic469.htm:104
msgctxt "comic469#p1.2"
msgid "Meaning I always have time to charge up a perfect shot!"
msgstr ""

#. comic469 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic469.htm:155
msgctxt "comic469#p2.1"
msgid "Radd, I doubt you need to go full-blast on these guys."
msgstr ""

#. comic469 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic469.htm:159
msgctxt "comic469#p2.2"
msgid "But it's fun!"
msgstr ""

#. comic469 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic469.htm:206
msgctxt "comic469#p3.1"
msgid "Uh guys, that may not be enough."
msgstr ""

#. comic469 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic469.htm:208
msgctxt "comic469#p3.2"
msgid "What the -?"
