#. comic470 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibnothing.gif, momenui.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:94
msgctxt "comic470#p1.1"
msgid "If these things keep multiplying, this battle will take <i>forever!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibnothing.gif, momenui.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:96
msgctxt "comic470#p1.2"
msgid "Yeah, but think of all the EXP."
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibnothing.gif, momenui.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:98
msgctxt "comic470#p1.3"
msgid "Watch and learn, guys."
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: momenug2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:149
msgctxt "comic470#p2.1"
msgid "Observe my favorite power: <b>Mind Control.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: momenug2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:153
msgctxt "comic470#p2.2"
msgid "Hmm? Is that some kinda Confusion spell?"
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenug2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:203
msgctxt "comic470#p3.1"
msgid "Sort of. Ironically, it's not really the opponent's mind, but rather their <i>body</i> I get to control.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: mospell.gif, momenu2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:254
msgctxt "comic470#p4.1"
msgid "Wait a minute... is that how I woke up wearing a tutu last week?"
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: mospell.gif, momenu2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:256
msgctxt "comic470#p4.2"
msgid "No Radd, you did that all by yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic470 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: mospell.gif, momenu2.gif
#: kidradd/comic470.htm:258
msgctxt "comic470#p4.3"
msgid "Ew."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:59
msgctxt "comic471#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"CRUEL MASTER\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:100
msgctxt "comic471#p1.1"
msgid "Guess I should attack the one you're not controlling, huh GI?"
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:104
msgctxt "comic471#p1.2"
msgid "That would be logical."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:154
msgctxt "comic471#p2.1"
msgid "And I'll use my turn to toss you one of my endless power-ups."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:158
msgctxt "comic471#p2.2"
msgid "Very wise."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenug.gif
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:207
msgctxt "comic471#p3.1"
msgid "And I, having no more need of my slave, shall dismiss him."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:258
msgctxt "comic471#p4.1"
msgid "That was cold, man."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:260
msgctxt "comic471#p4.2"
msgid "Sorry. I'll save 'im for you next time."
msgstr ""

#. comic471 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic471.htm:262
msgctxt "comic471#p4.3"
msgid "Skullboy, there's <i>definitely</i> something wrong with you."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:47
msgctxt "comic472#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"RED TAPE\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, ibsmug2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:88
msgctxt "comic472#p1.1"
msgid "That was groovy."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, ibsmug2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:92
msgctxt "comic472#p1.2"
msgid "Glad you liked it. I'm sure we'll be doing it again."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, ibwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:143
msgctxt "comic472#p2.1"
msgid "But not too often. According to Sheena, most of the time in RPGs is spent on leveling up the heroes."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, ibwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:147
msgctxt "comic472#p2.2"
msgid "Uh, you guys can't level up."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:200
msgctxt "comic472#p3.1"
msgid "Bingo. And we don't have to - we're already powerful enough to cruise through the necessary battles and skip all the rest. So we'll get through this game quickly - All we gotta do is get to the final level, and we'll be done in no time! Easy as pie!"
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, ib.gif, giguy.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:252
msgctxt "comic472#p4.1"
msgid "\"Halt! This road is closed!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: ibmad.gif, giguy.gif, raddcross.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:298
msgctxt "comic472#p5.1"
msgid "Two hours later..."
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, giguy.gif, raddcross.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:304
msgctxt "comic472#p5.2"
msgid "Okay, we've defeated the local crime syndicate, purchased lakeside real estate, walked Mrs. Lukach's dog, funded young produce entrepreneurs, collected the golden ticket, and called granny several times. Now can we pass?"
msgstr ""

#. comic472 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, giguy.gif, raddcross.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic472.htm:308
msgctxt "comic472#p5.3"
msgid "Uh...<br>\"Halt! This road is closed!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:47
msgctxt "comic473#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"DREAM COME TRUE\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giback2.gif, raddsigh.gif, ibmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:88
msgctxt "comic473#p1.1"
msgid "Stupid grotesquely huge-headed guy. What can't we just kick his butt?"
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giback2.gif, raddsigh.gif, ibmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:92
msgctxt "comic473#p1.2"
msgid "Cuz he's an NPC. His butt's as unkickable as mine."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giwalk.gif, raddmwalk.gif, ibwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:144
msgctxt "comic473#p2.1"
msgid "Whatever. Let's just give him the text-only item he wants, and never see him again."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giwalk.gif, raddmwalk.gif, ibwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:148
msgctxt "comic473#p2.2"
msgid "Oh, quit yer whining."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, raddstand.gif, ibmad2.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:197
msgctxt "comic473#p3.1"
msgid "I mean, this is a cool game and all, but it'd be a million times cooler if I could kick this guy's butt."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, raddstand.gif, ibmad2.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:199
msgctxt "comic473#p3.2"
msgid "Well you can't, so get over it."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: giguy.gif, raddwow.gif, ib.gif, burgle.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:254
msgctxt "comic473#p4.1"
msgid "\"Aye, tis what I've been longin' for! Okay, I'll let ye pass... if ye can best me in battle!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bigburgle.gif, momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:304
msgctxt "comic473#p5.1"
msgid "Wicked! Mr. Left Cheek, meet Mr. Adidas!"
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bigburgle.gif, momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:306
msgctxt "comic473#p5.2"
msgid "Grr, if only I could do the same..."
msgstr ""

#. comic473 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bigburgle.gif, momenu.gif
#: kidradd/comic473.htm:308
msgctxt "comic473#p5.3"
msgid "I wanted to come. I <i>wanted</i> to come."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:47
msgctxt "comic474#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"SKIP THE EXCUSES\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: momenur.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:88
msgctxt "comic474#p1.1"
msgid "Vengeance is mine!<br><i>Bwah ha ha hah!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: momenur.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:92
msgctxt "comic474#p1.2"
msgid "Oh brother..."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ib.gif, raddrock.gif, giguy2.gif, burgleow.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:143
msgctxt "comic474#p2.1"
msgid "Ah, I feel so much better now."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ib.gif, raddrock.gif, giguy2.gif, burgleow.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:145
msgctxt "comic474#p2.2"
msgid "You really enjoy violence, huh? An all too common, yet still reprehensible trait."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibhuh.gif, raddcross.gif, giguy.gif, burgleow.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:195
msgctxt "comic474#p3.1"
msgid "Wha- Wait a second! Who are you to say that? You weren't exactly merciful to that rabbit a while ago!"
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibhuh.gif, raddcross.gif, giguy.gif, burgleow.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:199
msgctxt "comic474#p3.2"
msgid "You're absolutely correct, I wasn't."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibwalk.gif, raddmwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:250
msgctxt "comic474#p4.1"
msgid "And?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibwalk.gif, raddmwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:252
msgctxt "comic474#p4.2"
msgid "And what?"
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought.gif, raddmright.gif, gileft.gif, ibtableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:303
msgctxt "comic474#p5.1"
msgid "This is the part where you're supposed to explain yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, raddmright.gif, gileft.gif, ibtableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:305
msgctxt "comic474#p5.2"
msgid "Sorry, don't feel like it."
msgstr ""

#. comic474 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, raddmright.gif, gileft.gif, ibtableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic474.htm:307
msgctxt "comic474#p5.3"
msgid "<b>Definitely</b> something wrong with this guy..."
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:34
msgctxt "comic475#title.1"
msgid "\"NICE AND SLOW\""
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, bogeystand.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:75
msgctxt "comic475#p1.1"
msgid "Is everything still going well in there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, bogeystand.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:79
msgctxt "comic475#p1.2"
msgid "\"Yes, Dr. Amp. More or less...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: amptable.gif, nursetalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:130
msgctxt "comic475#p2.1"
msgid "\"More or less?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amptable.gif, nursetalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:134
msgctxt "comic475#p2.2"
msgid "\"Well, it's gonna take awhile. We're pretty unstoppable, but it'll still be several hours before we get though all the hoops to reach the end.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, bogeystand.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:180
msgctxt "comic475#p3.1"
msgid "Keep in mind, this is for the possible salvation of our world, so success is important. Take as much time as you need."
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, bogeystand.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:184
msgctxt "comic475#p3.2"
msgid "\"Don't say that too loudly...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gitable2.gif, beatniks.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:232
msgctxt "comic475#p4.1"
msgid "...Or I'll never get these two fools off the stage."
msgstr ""

#. comic475 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gitable2.gif, beatniks.gif
#: kidradd/comic475.htm:236
msgctxt "comic475#p4.2"
msgid "\"Hero sprite, Nasty plight.<br>NPC, Fancy free...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:34
msgctxt "comic476#title.1"
msgid "\"BETTER DAYS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeysigh2.gif, nursetalk2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:76
msgctxt "comic476#p1.1"
msgid "Well, I'm outta here for now. Have fun, um, monitoring them."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeysigh2.gif, nursetalk2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:80
msgctxt "comic476#p1.2"
msgid "You betcha!"
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeytable14.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:133
msgctxt "comic476#p2.1"
msgid "Sidelined again, natch. But at least it's not everytime anymore."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeytable5.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:184
msgctxt "comic476#p3.1"
msgid "Heck, I'm even ideal in certain games. Like puzzlers full of enemies, where the heroes are weak wusses."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeytable13.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:238
msgctxt "comic476#p4.1"
msgid "But that's rare. Most of the time I'm still the least usable guy in any given situation. And as much as I hate to admit it, it does bother me."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, bogeystand.gif, sheenatwin.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:290
msgctxt "comic476#p5.1"
msgid "Though other problems bother me more..."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, bogeystand.gif, sheenatwin.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:292
msgctxt "comic476#p5.2"
msgid "Oh, hi Bogey."
msgstr ""

#. comic476 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, bogeystand.gif, sheenatwin.gif
#: kidradd/comic476.htm:294
msgctxt "comic476#p5.3"
msgid "Tee-hee!"
msgstr ""

#. comic477 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic477.htm:53
msgctxt "comic477#title.1"
msgid "\"IT AIN'T EASY BEING GREEN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic477 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic477.htm:94
msgctxt "comic477#p1.1"
msgid "I was just going to check..."
msgstr ""

#. comic477 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic477.htm:98
msgctxt "comic477#p1.2"
msgid "Yeah, Radd's fine in there. But he'll appreciate ya saying hi."
msgstr ""

#. comic477 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastare2.gif, bogeywalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic477.htm:149
msgctxt "comic477#p2.1"
msgid "Thanks. ...See ya."
msgstr ""

#. comic477 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastare2.gif, bogeywalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic477.htm:153
msgctxt "comic477#p2.2"
msgid "Yeah, see ya..."
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:34
msgctxt "comic478#title.1"
msgid "\"NEW WORLD ORDER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeydwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:78
msgctxt "comic478#p1.1"
msgid "We broke out of those stupid little games, into a world where we were supposedly free to make our own destinies... but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeywalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:134
msgctxt "comic478#p2.1"
msgid "Truthfully, very little changed. In that civil, orderly little society sprites like me were <i>still</i> just part of the background."
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeyswalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:186
msgctxt "comic478#p3.1"
msgid "And of course when that world crumbled, when war began, we were thrust even further into the background! Fighters are valued now, not little walking targets."
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeytable13.gif
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:239
msgctxt "comic478#p4.1"
msgid "Though it wasn't her intention, Crystal's stupid war is forcing us to live out the roles we were programmed for. Considering her own refusal to fulfill her role, I'd bet she'd hate that bit of irony."
msgstr ""

#. comic478 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeybwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic478.htm:293
msgctxt "comic478#p5.1"
msgid "Well Crystal, we too would like to set up a world where those stupid roles are meaningless. ...Just not one that much resembles yours."
msgstr ""

#. comic479 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic479.htm:48
msgctxt "comic479#title.1"
msgid "\"WON'T BACK DOWN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic479 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeywalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic479.htm:92
msgctxt "comic479#p1.1"
msgid "Ah, screw it. I don't care if my part in this war is a trillionth the size of Radd's; I'll do whatever the hell I can."
msgstr ""

#. comic479 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeygwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic479.htm:147
msgctxt "comic479#p2.1"
msgid "Sooner or later my skills will be needed and I'll make my contribution. When the world is saved thanks to me, every lady sprite on the web will be fawning over yours truly."
msgstr ""

#. comic479 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeyjwalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic479.htm:252
msgctxt "comic479#p4.1"
msgid "Oh yeah. Fear the awesome powers of the minor enemy sprite."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:35
msgctxt "comic480#title.1"
msgid "\"ASKING AMP\""
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:76
msgctxt "comic480#p1.1"
msgid "Dr. Amp?"
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:80
msgctxt "comic480#p1.2"
msgid "Hi, Sheena. And yes, everything's running smoothly in the game."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:131
msgctxt "comic480#p2.1"
msgid "That's a relief. But the enormity of this mission has made me think - if the guys pull this off, this'll really be it. The final battle will be coming soon."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:135
msgctxt "comic480#p2.2"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenatabled.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:185
msgctxt "comic480#p3.1"
msgid "And even though we'd be on the side more likely to win... well, life's unpredictable. You just never know. And with Radd, out of nervousness and inconvenience I've been avoiding - no, we've <i>both</i> been avoiding - talking about anything personal."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenatableq.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:235
msgctxt "comic480#p4.1"
msgid "Inbetween this crazy life on the ship and the unresolved arguments with my sister, I haven't really told Radd what I think about him. And now, if we're all going to be in the battle of our lives, this may be my last chance. Sir, what do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p6
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenawstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:284
msgctxt "comic480#p6.1"
msgid "\"I say go for it!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenafume.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:330
msgctxt "comic480#p7.1"
msgid "Perhaps I should've mentioned that the com is on."
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p7
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenafume.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:332
msgctxt "comic480#p7.2"
msgid "You could at least eavesdrop in silence!"
msgstr ""

#. comic480 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenafume.gif
#: kidradd/comic480.htm:334
msgctxt "comic480#p7.3"
msgid "\"Radd, you're in for it now...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic481 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic481.htm:53
msgctxt "comic481#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"CRYSTAL BLUE PERSUASION\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic481 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic481.htm:90
msgctxt "comic481#p1.1"
msgid "The three continue their journey..."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:36
msgctxt "comic482#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"DON'T SPEAK\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: volcano.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:77
msgctxt "comic482#p1.1"
msgid "I've really been enjoying this game!"
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: volcano.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:79
msgctxt "comic482#p1.2"
msgid "Yeah, I'll second that."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: volcano.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:81
msgctxt "comic482#p1.3"
msgid "For some reason, it all makes my skin crawl."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibhwalk.gif, raddhwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:130
msgctxt "comic482#p2.1"
msgid "Toss the negative vibe, man! You're just feedin' the war machine!"
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibhwalk.gif, raddhwalk.gif, giwalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:134
msgctxt "comic482#p2.2"
msgid "I don't know what that means, and neither do you."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibtableb.gif, raddtable5.gif, gitableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:183
msgctxt "comic482#p3.1"
msgid "Anyways, we've got to be nearly done. This \"Land of the Lost Underground\" place is dead-ending."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibtableb.gif, raddtable5.gif, gitableb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:187
msgctxt "comic482#p3.2"
msgid "Ask that guy if he knows anything."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, elleft.gif, gileft.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:234
msgctxt "comic482#p4.1"
msgid "He's not much of a chatterbox."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, elleft.gif, gileft.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:238
msgctxt "comic482#p4.2"
msgid "Hey buddy, wake up. We're doing the \"talk to everybody\" thing here, and it helps if you cooperate."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwright.gif, elmad.gif, gileft.gif, ibhuh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:285
msgctxt "comic482#p6.1"
msgid "I'm thinking bugging him might be a bad idea."
msgstr ""

#. comic482 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwright.gif, elmad.gif, gileft.gif, ibhuh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic482.htm:289
msgctxt "comic482#p6.2"
msgid "Look, just pretend I'm pressing the \"A\" button, and say whatever comes to mind."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:53
msgctxt "comic483#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"JUST ASK\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif, elhappy2.gif, gileft.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:94
msgctxt "comic483#p1.1"
msgid "See GI, ya just give him a Cookie, and he's all nice!"
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif, elhappy2.gif, gileft.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:96
msgctxt "comic483#p1.2"
msgid "Though uselessly mute."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif, elhappy2.gif, gileft.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:98
msgctxt "comic483#p1.3"
msgid "That probably means he's one of this game's heroes."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddblink.gif, giguy2.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:145
msgctxt "comic483#p2.1"
msgid "One lengthy explanation later..."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, giguy2.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:151
msgctxt "comic483#p2.2"
msgid "So... wanna go see the boss with us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, giguy2.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:155
msgctxt "comic483#p2.3"
msgid "I guess that's a yes."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:199
msgctxt "comic483#p3.1"
msgid "\"Great. Can you show us how to get there?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibback.gif, giback.gif, elback.gif, raddback.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:257
msgctxt "comic483#p4.1"
msgid "Wow. I guess that's also a yes."
msgstr ""

#. comic483 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibback.gif, giback.gif, elback.gif, raddback.gif
#: kidradd/comic483.htm:259
msgctxt "comic483#p4.2"
msgid "Spooooo-kay..."
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:36
msgctxt "comic484#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"DO SPEAK\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:77
msgctxt "comic484#p1.1"
msgid "So you've almost reached your destination?"
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:79
msgctxt "comic484#p1.2"
msgid "\"Maybe. If we ever get there...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibjog.gif, girun.gif, raddrun.gif, elrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:134
msgctxt "comic484#p2.1"
msgid "Well this certainly is... scenic. Talkin' bout your long and winding roads here."
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddrun.gif, elrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:186
msgctxt "comic484#p3.1"
msgid "I don't suppose you could Teleport us any closer to the boss, huh?<br>I guess maybe not."
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibjog.gif, girun.gif, raddrun.gif, elrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:238
msgctxt "comic484#p4.1"
msgid "You know a really fun word? ASCII. Just say it slowly. ...ASCII."
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibjog.gif, girun.gif, raddrun.gif, elrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:287
msgctxt "comic484#p6.1"
msgid "Great, one guy doesn't talk, and the other never shuts up."
msgstr ""

#. comic484 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibjog.gif, girun.gif, raddrun.gif, elrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic484.htm:291
msgctxt "comic484#p6.2"
msgid "I heard that! Oh wait, that was prolly the idea."
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:53
msgctxt "comic485#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"WIRED\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:96
msgctxt "comic485#p1.1"
msgid "Finally, this is it. Let's give this boss a talkin' to."
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: grouphi.gif
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:151
msgctxt "comic485#p2.1"
msgid "Uh, hi?... Mr. Boss Person? Can we have a word with you? Hello?"
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:200
msgctxt "comic485#p3.1"
msgid "Nothing. Maybe we gotta activate something -"
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:204
msgctxt "comic485#p3.2"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:252
msgctxt "comic485#p4.1"
msgid "Okay, I think I found him."
msgstr ""

#. comic485 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic485.htm:256
msgctxt "comic485#p4.2"
msgid "Great. Welcome to wireframe hell."
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:59
msgctxt "comic486#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"E I E I O\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:102
msgctxt "comic486#p1.1"
msgid "Hello there Mr., um... Boss. We've come a long way, and we'd like a word with you."
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:158
msgctxt "comic486#p2.1"
msgid "Well... huh. That's not exactly what I had in mind. Are those even words?"
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:210
msgctxt "comic486#p3.1"
msgid "Hey, watch it! <b>No!</b> No, we're not here to battle!"
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:261
msgctxt "comic486#p4.1"
msgid "He's out of his mind!"
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:263
msgctxt "comic486#p4.2"
msgid "In some ways, we all are."
msgstr ""

#. comic486 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic486.htm:265
msgctxt "comic486#p4.3"
msgid "This doesn't look promising."
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:71
msgctxt "comic487#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"ALL I WANT TO SAY TO YOU\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:114
msgctxt "comic487#p1.1"
msgid "Let's try this again. We're not players, just sprites who want to talk with you."
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:170
msgctxt "comic487#p2.1"
msgid "And... Yeah. Again with the babbling. Please, just give us some inkling that there's a brain in there."
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:222
msgctxt "comic487#p3.1"
msgid "...That you can do anything other than - Oh, crap."
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:273
msgctxt "comic487#p4.1"
msgid "It's hopeless, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:275
msgctxt "comic487#p4.2"
msgid "It sure ain't hopeful."
msgstr ""

#. comic487 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic487.htm:277
msgctxt "comic487#p4.3"
msgid "Just another slave to his programming. Pathetic."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:59
msgctxt "comic488#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"SO SORRY\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:100
msgctxt "comic488#p1.1"
msgid "Sigh, and we came so far... Alright Eliot, just Teleport us outta here."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:104
msgctxt "comic488#p1.2"
msgid "Wait, Radd."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:156
msgctxt "comic488#p2.1"
msgid "I'm pretty sure that spell isn't usable during battle."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:160
msgctxt "comic488#p2.2"
msgid "It isn't? Well, no biggie."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:210
msgctxt "comic488#p3.1"
msgid "Eliot, please use that \"Meditate\" move to finish this fight, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:261
msgctxt "comic488#p4.1"
msgid "I don't think he has that move. Wrong character."
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:263
msgctxt "comic488#p4.2"
msgid "<b>What?</b> Why didn't he tell us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic488 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic488.htm:265
msgctxt "comic488#p4.3"
msgid "Idiots."
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:71
msgctxt "comic489#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"SEE CLEARLY NOW\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:112
msgctxt "comic489#p1.1"
msgid "We can't be stuck here! This is scarier than the last RPG I got trapped in!"
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:116
msgctxt "comic489#p1.2"
msgid "Relax Radd, we'll think of something."
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:168
msgctxt "comic489#p2.1"
msgid "How the heck do you know so much about this place anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:172
msgctxt "comic489#p2.2"
msgid "I dunno, I've just got a sense about it."
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:222
msgctxt "comic489#p3.1"
msgid "After all, I'm from an RPG; I know how these things work. And... hmm, interesting."
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:273
msgctxt "comic489#p4.1"
msgid "What? What's interesting?"
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:275
msgctxt "comic489#p4.2"
msgid "I just figured out that Sheena was wrong. This guy <i>isn't</i> invincible."
msgstr ""

#. comic489 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu6.gif
#: kidradd/comic489.htm:277
msgctxt "comic489#p4.3"
msgid "Superb. Let's trash him."
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:71
msgctxt "comic490#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"ACHTUNG, BABY\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:112
msgctxt "comic490#p1.1"
msgid "I'd expected this guy to be a being with no lifemeter, like me. But he's not."
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:116
msgctxt "comic490#p1.2"
msgid "How do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:170
msgctxt "comic490#p2.1"
msgid "He's resetting his HP every turn. There's no text message, but I can tell it's what he's doing. Clever."
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:222
msgctxt "comic490#p3.1"
msgid "I guess the programmers didn't really make him unbeatable - just too powerful for the game's heroes."
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:273
msgctxt "comic490#p4.1"
msgid "So can we beat him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:275
msgctxt "comic490#p4.2"
msgid "If we can score 9999 damage in one turn."
msgstr ""

#. comic490 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu5.gif
#: kidradd/comic490.htm:277
msgctxt "comic490#p4.3"
msgid "I'll take that challenge."
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:36
msgctxt "comic491#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"FOOL'S WAGER\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:79
msgctxt "comic491#p1.1"
msgid "Wait a second, is beating this guy a good idea? I mean, what'll the game do if we don't beat him the normal way?"
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: grouphi.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:134
msgctxt "comic491#p2.1"
msgid "Hopefully when the battle ends we'll just end up in the same map location. Then again, the game may freeze up."
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:183
msgctxt "comic491#p3.1"
msgid "I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:187
msgctxt "comic491#p3.2"
msgid "Well, I don't think that'd kill us, but we'd definitely be stuck here until a human player restarts the game."
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:236
msgctxt "comic491#p4.1"
msgid "But that might not happen for months, or years... or <i>ever!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic491 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, momenu3.gif
#: kidradd/comic491.htm:240
msgctxt "comic491#p4.2"
msgid "I didn't say it was a perfect plan. ...Just all we've got."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#. images: mlogo.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:71
msgctxt "comic492#title.1"
msgid "<font color=\"ffffff\" face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><b>&copy;199X SIMIAN SOFTWARE<br>Press Start</b></font><br><br><font color=\"ffffff\" class=\"rundschrift\" face=\"VAG Rundschrift D, arial\" size=\"3\">\"THE THOUGHT COUNTS\"</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, mocharge2.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:112
msgctxt "comic492#p1.1"
msgid "Alright, if we each use our best attacks, hopefully it'll be enough."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, mocharge2.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:114
msgctxt "comic492#p1.2"
msgid "Oh, it will."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: geniac.gif, mocharge2.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:116
msgctxt "comic492#p1.3"
msgid "Here goes nothin'."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3r.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:169
msgctxt "comic492#p2.1"
msgid "I might as well start things off."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3i.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:221
msgctxt "comic492#p3.1"
msgid "Apparently cures hurt this guy. Heh."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: momenu3e.gif
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:274
msgctxt "comic492#p4.1"
msgid "Go get 'im, Eliot!"
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:323
msgctxt "comic492#p5.1"
msgid "That was nice, but you guys didn't need to contribute <i>that</i> much damage."
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:325
msgctxt "comic492#p5.2"
msgid "Gah!"
msgstr ""

#. comic492 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic492.htm:327
msgctxt "comic492#p5.3"
msgid "Show-off."
msgstr ""

#. comic493 panel title
